[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0295","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0295","title":"Solaris sysdef 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统 sysdef 命令存在内核内存泄露缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该命令读取内核敏感数据，进而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.3、2.4、2.5 和 2.5.1 版本，攻击者需要本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0295"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 系统至厂商提供的最新补丁级别，限制普通用户对 sysdef 命令的执行权限，或移除 sysdef 命令的 setuid 位。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T21:21:02Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/157","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/583"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0295.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0363","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0182","title":"Samba Samba 1.9.19 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Samba 1.9.19 及更早版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Samba 服务发送特制的超长密码字符串触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行 Samba 1.9.19 的 Unix/Linux 系统，无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0182"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-09-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Samba 至 2.0.0 及以上版本（1.9.19 系列已停止维护，2.0.0 修复了该缓冲区溢出问题）。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 中设置 hosts allow/deny 限制可访问 SMB 服务的源 IP 范围，并在防火墙层面屏蔽 TCP 端口 139 和 445 的外部访问以临时缓解风险。现代 Linux 发行版应直接使用系统包管理器更新至当前受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/h-110.shtml","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20308","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0182.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0182.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0182","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0182.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/samba/gb_samba_CVE-1999-0182.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2f876a2c24d5ccd5bbd081f09e801e580536456a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0182.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/292.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vc5j-x9w7-frw6/GHSA-vc5j-x9w7-frw6.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/02ed2a2b96fc19fd49a4be810f3493abb776ec4e/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2020/samba/gb_samba_CVE-1999-0182.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0470","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0282","title":"（已废弃）CVE-1999-0282 错误合并 SunOS loadmodule 两个独立漏洞的无效编号","description":"CVE-1999-0282 是一个已被官方驳回（REJECTED）的 CVE 编号，原因是它错误地将 CVE-1999-1584 和 CVE-1999-1586 两个不同漏洞的参考信息和描述合并为一条记录。NVD 已移除该编号下所有描述与引用，禁止继续使用。该编号不指向任何真实存在的漏洞，不存在可利用的攻击面或影响范围。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0282"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-09-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:56Z","remediation":"CVE-1999-0282 已被撤销，请勿使用此编号。实际漏洞分别对应 CVE-1999-1584（SunOS 4.1.1–4.1.3c 及 Open Windows 3.0 中 loadmodule/modload 的本地权限提升）和 CVE-1999-1586（SunOS 4.1.x 中 xnews 调用的 loadmodule 未正确清理环境变量导致本地提权）。Sun 当时发布了补丁（如 Sun patch 100124-01），CERT 也发布了公告 CA-1993-18，但这些补丁现已无法获取。由于 SunOS 4.x 早已停止支持，建议将仍在运行的 SunOS 4.1.x 系统迁移至受支持的操作系统（如 Solaris 11、Linux 或 \\*BSD），同时严格控制 setuid/setgid 二进制文件的权限以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0452","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0452.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0267","title":"NCSA HTTPd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NCSA HTTPd 1.3 版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区越界写入，进而实现远程命令执行。该漏洞影响 NCSA HTTPd 1.x 系列版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0267"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-09-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:02Z","remediation":"NCSA HTTPd 已停止维护多年，建议立即迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.x 或 Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器。迁移后需重新配置虚拟主机、访问控制和 SSL 证书，并关闭旧服务器上的 80/443 端口。如无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面限制对 80 端口的访问来源 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0267","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21050","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/1999/CVE-1999-0267.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d92a0abc5d3abac6dcdfabfef6fd71c158e0fd8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0267.json","https://github.com/geeknik/the-nuclei-templates/blob/36a6d14bce3293907a83afb498caec5fd45b1777/CVE-1999-0267.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0267","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0267.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-1999-0267.yaml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0267.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0267.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-1999-0267.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0452.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0452.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0452.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1237","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1237.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0955","title":"wu-ftpd和BSDI ftpd SITE EXEC命令竞争条件漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd和BSDI ftpd在处理SITE EXEC命令时存在竞争条件漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送特制的SITE EXEC请求，在竞争窗口内利用条件竞争绕过权限检查，从而获取root用户权限，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，但成功利用后危害极大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0955"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-09-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该漏洞的wu-ftpd或BSDI ftpd版本，或禁用SITE EXEC命令。对于已停止维护的系统，建议迁移至更安全的FTP服务器软件如vsftpd，并限制FTP服务的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T04:28:25Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0955"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1249","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0965","title":"X.Org xterm 日志选项竞争条件本地文件修改漏洞","description":"xterm 的日志功能（logging option）存在竞争条件漏洞，本地攻击者可通过利用该竞争条件，在日志文件写入过程中篡改目标文件的符号链接或内容，从而实现向任意文件写入数据的目的。该漏洞影响使用 xterm 终端的类 Unix 系统，攻击者需具备本地登录权限或 shell 访问能力才能触发利用。成功利用可导致本地权限提升或对系统文件进行未授权修改，危害等级中等。建议升级 xterm 至最新版本，并在多用户环境中合理配置终端权限以降低风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0965"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-09-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:25Z","remediation":"升级 xterm 至 Patch #131（2000/03/03 发布）或更高版本，该补丁将 creat_as() 函数中的 O_APPEND 替换为 O_EXCL，并在打开日志文件后增加所有权和写权限校验，从而消除日志选项中的竞争条件。如无法立即升级，可临时通过 X 资源文件将 xterm 的 logfile 选项设为禁用状态，或在终端启动参数中取消 -l 选项以关闭日志功能，避免本地用户利用竞争窗口篡改任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0965","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20b9340dcaffca733259fb153ac741206a5bbc5f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0965.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0965","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/b6ed432383ec9e70047ae649904e3a43ee847c40/upstream-layers/meta-openembedded/meta-oe/recipes-graphics/xorg-app/xterm_410.bb","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0965.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e90735e3e31fc62018265dfbae313d166e653462/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0965.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3vvm-3j5j-gc9q/GHSA-3vvm-3j5j-gc9q.json","https://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded/blob/e93799db0e7c7b23da8a00891403425ae7e87d7b/meta-oe/recipes-graphics/xorg-app/xterm_410.bb","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88403/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0965.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1249.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0993","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0993.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0667","title":"ARP 协议 ARP 缓存投毒 拒绝服务欺骗漏洞","description":"ARP 协议缺乏身份验证机制，允许局域网内任意主机伪造 ARP 回复包投毒 ARP 缓存，导致 IP 地址欺骗或拒绝服务攻击。攻击者只需接入同一广播域，发送伪造的 ARP 应答将目标 IP 映射到攻击者 MAC 地址，即可劫持流量、窃取数据或中断通信。该漏洞影响所有使用标准 ARP 协议的 IPv4 网络设备，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0667"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-09-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:48Z","remediation":"在交换机上启用动态 ARP 检测 (DAI) 和 DHCP Snooping 功能，对关键服务器配置静态 ARP 条目，部署 ARP 欺骗检测工具（如 arpwatch），并在主机侧启用数据包签名或使用 IPSec 加密通信以缓解 ARP 缓存投毒攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602880019797&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d0ba8eaeba3ff3558e6044a19d5b454dcc12f33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0667.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0667","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/e308a62e3fd448dc7e655afff41cb1de4b41d101/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0667.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e54d5f68d5b83411d51ab3df8f5c1b120360f139/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0667.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/a882eda2674c920d46c962c584db177720af345c/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt","https://github.com/based2/KB/blob/c9cae949a7a9adb4f8bf8a6864a48f7defc467d7/security/vulnerabities.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0667.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88350/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0993.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1343","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1343.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1125","title":"Oracle Webserver 2.1 及更早版本 setuid root 配置权限提升漏洞","description":"Oracle Webserver 2.1 及更早版本以 setuid root 权限运行，但配置文件归 oracle 账户所有。任何获得 oracle 账户访问权限的本地或远程攻击者均可通过修改配置文件，利用 setuid root 权限提升至 root 权限，或修改任意文件，造成系统完全失陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1125"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1997-09-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Oracle Webserver 2.1 以上版本，或将配置文件所有权改为 root 用户并移除 oracle 账户的写权限，避免配置被低权限用户篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T02:09:59Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602880019796&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1343.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1239","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0956","title":"NeXT NetInfo _writers 属性本地权限提升与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NeXT NetInfo 的 _writers 属性存在本地权限提升与拒绝服务漏洞。拥有本地普通用户权限的攻击者可通过滥用 _writers 属性以 root 身份执行任意操作，或触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 NeXTSTEP 和 OPENSTEP 操作系统，攻击条件简单，仅需具备本地用户账户即可完成利用，CVSS v2 评分为 7.2，对系统的机密性、完整性和可用性均造成完全损害。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0956"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-09-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 NeXTSTEP/OPENSTEP 操作系统，无官方补丁。应将系统迁移至受支持的现代操作系统（如 macOS、Linux）；短期内应禁用不必要的本地用户账户、限制物理接触、通过防火墙禁止远程登录以降低本地利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0956","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/184a5a0fb7dfcbb1c5bcfd5178078c78dc1e4738/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0956.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/95eeda559fd899397df50f658cf25cf01bb1e4ea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0956.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0956.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1403","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1214","title":"FreeBSD 内核异步 I/O 凭证校验缺失导致本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"4.4 BSD 内核中的异步 I/O 机制存在权限校验缺失漏洞。在设置 I/O 通知信号的接收进程时，内核未对用户凭证进行检查，导致本地攻击者可通过特定的 ioctl 和 fcntl 系统调用，将信号发送到任意进程 ID。本地低权限用户无需特殊授权即可利用此漏洞，向任意进程（包括高权限系统进程）发送信号，从而干扰或终止其正常运行，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响基于 4.4 BSD 内核的 FreeBSD 等操作系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级较低，利用需具备本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1214"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-09-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:57Z","remediation":"建议升级 FreeBSD 至 4.4-RELEASE 或更高版本（已修补该内核异步 I/O 权限校验缺陷）。若暂无法升级，可通过内核参数限制普通用户对 ioctl/fcntl 的调用权限，或在防火墙层面限制本地特权用户滥用信号发送接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.com/advisories/signals.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/11062","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/556","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7dbcfe83bb4dc502ef05181d3fc65159afa615a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1214.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1214","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1214.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fb79aaf8eeeb3ec551114292cd7a8693e166aee6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1214.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6da213119b3c54637329347c0dc42c66b8a84f0a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2wrh-h883-mcp8/GHSA-2wrh-h883-mcp8.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88608/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/1999/CVE-1999-1214.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--142fad7b-6c79-49ea-b725-b5b8c343ccc0.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0192","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0192.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0079","title":"Sun Solaris 7/8 FTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 7 和 Solaris 8 系统的 FTP 服务器存在资源耗尽漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标 FTP 服务发送大量 PASV 命令，导致服务器可用端口被迅速耗尽，从而使合法用户无法建立新的数据连接，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用门槛低，仅需网络可达即可触发，影响运行上述 Solaris 版本的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0079"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-09-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:31Z","remediation":"建议安装 Sun 官方补丁 ID 106222-02 (Solaris 7) 或 106223-02 (Solaris 8)，限制单连接内 PASV 命令的并发端口数。也可在 in.ftpd 配置中降低 PASV 最小端口范围或缩短空闲端口超时。如无法升级，可在防火墙限制 FTP 控制连接速率作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0079"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0192.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1444","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1444.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1275","title":"Lotus cc:Mail 明文密码存储权限提升漏洞","description":"Lotus cc:Mail 8 版本存在密码明文存储漏洞，系统将邮箱服务器密码以明文形式存储于隐藏文件中，且该文件权限配置不当，本地普通用户可读取该文件获取管理员密码，进而实现权限提升。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限即可利用该漏洞，影响范围限于 Lotus cc:Mail 8 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，属于中危漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1275"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-09-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:05Z","remediation":"Lotus cc:Mail 8 已停止维护，无官方补丁，建议迁移至 IBM Domino 或受支持的邮件系统；暂无法迁移时，收紧 cc:Mail 隐藏口令文件（如 .cclm）权限为 600（仅属主读写），并通过系统 ACL 禁止非管理员用户读取该文件，同时使用主机防火墙限制本地非授权进程的网络访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9478","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1619","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1275.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1275","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1275.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1275.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7mxx-wrm5-32f9/GHSA-7mxx-wrm5-32f9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87812/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1275.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/839e2559933f5ff6cd50b4768fd382827d790668/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1444.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0374","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0374.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0191","title":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 newdsn.exe 文件创建漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 的 newdsn.exe CGI 脚本存在文件创建/覆盖漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制 HTTP 请求利用此脚本，在服务器上任意创建或覆盖文件，可能导致系统配置被篡改或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 IIS 3.0 版本，攻击复杂度较低，无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0191"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:51Z","remediation":"立即删除 IIS 3.0 服务器上的 newdsn.exe 文件或将其所在 cgi-bin 目录权限设置为禁止匿名访问；同时升级至 IIS 4.0 或更高版本以彻底消除该 CGI 脚本，或迁移至受支持的 Windows Server 版本并启用最新安全配置。若无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 过滤规则拦截对 newdsn.exe 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/275","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20309","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0191.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0191","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0191.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0191.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0191.json","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p6cp-hx87-7342/GHSA-p6cp-hx87-7342.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0191.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-iis.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/N/newdsn.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0374.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0374.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0353","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0177","title":"O'Reilly WebSite 服务器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WebSite Web 服务器中的 uploader 程序存在任意文件上传漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的上传请求，将恶意可执行文件上传至服务器任意目录并远程执行，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响早期版本的 WebSite 服务器软件，攻击者只需能够网络访问目标服务器即可发起攻击，利用方式简单、危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0177"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:45Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 O'Reilly WebSite Professional 2.x（该版本已修复 uploader 漏洞）；如无法升级，可直接删除或禁用 webroot 下的 uploader.exe/cgi 程序，并在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面限制对 uploader 相关路径的访问。由于该产品已终止技术支持（EOL），长期解决方案是迁移至仍在安全维护期的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx 或 IIS）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0177"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0258","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0258.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0115","title":"IBM AIX bugfiler 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"AIX 3.x 操作系统中的 bugfiler 程序存在任意文件创建漏洞，本地攻击者利用该程序可创建或覆盖系统文件，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 AIX 3.x 版本，攻击者仅需本地账户即可利用，无需用户交互，危害较高，CVSS 评分 7.2。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0115"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:37Z","remediation":"升级 AIX 系统至 4.1.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续发行版中修复。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/bugfiler` 移除 setuid 特权位，防止本地用户通过 bugfiler 获取 root Shell；若无需使用 bugfiler 工具，可直接 `chmod 700 /usr/bin/bugfiler` 限制仅 root 可执行。请评估是否需同时更新 `bos.rte.security` 文件集的相关安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1800","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20290","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0115.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0115","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0115.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0115.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0115.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pf77-c4gh-6m4v/GHSA-pf77-c4gh-6m4v.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0115.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0258.toml"}]